OL,3,GNEWSADry weather forces pumpkin picking
OL,4,Afields to close
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo farms in Kent have cancelled their
OL,7,Fpick-your-own pumpkin events after dry
OL,8,Fweather hit this year's crops.
OL,10,FBroadditch Farm in Southfleet would
OL,11,Fnormally have harvested 25,000 to
OL,12,F30,000 pumpkins in autumn, but this
OL,13,Fyear expects to have around 1,500.
OL,15,FFarmer John Harris said the pumpkins
OL,16,Fhad not got going this year because of
OL,17,Fthe lack of moisture, adding: "We're
OL,18,Fsuffering. We've only harvested a tenth
OL,19,Fof what we should have done."
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
