OL,3,GNEWSADry weather forces pumpkin picking
OL,4,Afields to close
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Wonky Parsnip at Brogdale Farm in
OL,7,FFaversham is also not opening its
OL,8,Fpick-your-own pumpkin patch this year.
OL,9,FOwner Laura Brady wrote on Facebook she
OL,10,Fwas "absolutely gutted".
